00:33:13.087 --> 00:33:14.282
What did you say to make that happen?

00:33:14.282 --> 00:33:15.483
- I don't know.

00:33:15.483 --> 00:33:17.372
- You must have said something.

00:33:17.372 --> 00:33:19.021
Captain Lee reversed himself.

00:33:19.021 --> 00:33:20.419
What did you say?

00:33:20.419 --> 00:33:21.944
- I don't know the exact words.

00:33:21.944 --> 00:33:23.141
- Let me help you.

00:33:23.141 --> 00:33:24.040
- Your honor.

00:33:24.040 --> 00:33:25.950
- You said, waste the
motherfuckers, didn't you?

00:33:25.950 --> 00:33:26.839
- No, no, no.

00:33:26.839 --> 00:33:28.022
- You didn't say it?

00:33:28.022 --> 00:33:29.905
- Well, it all happened so fast.

00:33:29.905 --> 00:33:31.630
- You're under oath Colonel.

00:33:31.630 --> 00:33:33.864
Let me refresh your memory.

00:33:33.864 --> 00:33:36.395
This is Exhibit Q, a tape recording made

00:33:36.395 --> 00:33:39.432
aboard the USS Wake Island
of all radio communications

00:33:39.432 --> 00:33:42.849
received that day,
including your exact words.

00:33:42.849 --> 00:33:44.084
Your Honor, with your permission,

00:33:44.084 --> 00:33:45.608
I would like to play this tape.

00:33:45.608 --> 00:33:47.254
- Well if you got it on tape,
then that's what I said.

00:33:47.254 --> 00:33:49.970
They were killing my
Marines so yeah I said it.

00:33:49.970 --> 00:33:51.970
Waste the motherfuckers.

00:33:53.759 --> 00:33:55.119
- Are these the motherfuckers?

00:33:55.119 --> 00:33:56.643
- Objection.
- Overruled.

00:33:56.643 --> 00:33:57.893
- Yes.
- These?

00:33:58.993 --> 00:34:00.243
- Yes.
- These?

00:34:01.921 --> 00:34:03.533
- Objection.
- Overruled.

00:34:03.533 --> 00:34:04.366
- Yes.

00:34:04.366 --> 00:34:06.667
- Are these the motherfuckers
that you ordered

00:34:06.667 --> 00:34:08.153
to be wasted?

00:34:08.153 --> 00:34:09.721
- Your Honor.
- Major.

00:34:09.721 --> 00:34:10.568
- Yes!
- Your Honor.

00:34:10.568 --> 00:34:13.172
- The crowd in front of
the embassy had no weapons,

00:34:13.172 --> 00:34:14.538
did they, Colonel?

00:34:14.538 --> 00:34:15.935
- Objection; we wound no
sniper's weapons either.

00:34:15.935 --> 00:34:17.543
- Yes they had weapons.

00:34:17.543 --> 00:34:19.543
You think there's a
script for fighting a war

00:34:19.543 --> 00:34:21.331
without pissing somebody off?

00:34:21.331 --> 00:34:22.164
Follow the rules and nobody gets hurt?

00:34:22.164 --> 00:34:24.677
Yes, innocent people probably died.

00:34:24.677 --> 00:34:26.327
Innocent people always die,

00:34:26.327 --> 00:34:28.729
but I did not exceed my order.

00:34:28.729 --> 00:34:31.813
- There are rules, and Marines
are sworn to uphold them.

00:34:31.813 --> 00:34:34.484
- I was not going to stand
by and see another Marine die

00:34:34.484 --> 00:34:37.374
just to live by those fucking rules.

00:34:37.374 --> 00:34:41.541
- (strikes gavel twice) Colonel ...

